### Check first
Open [this component](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/highlights) and its [metrics](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/metrics). Inspect the latest HTTP probe result, configured URL, credentials and pod readiness. The configured threshold is **{{threshold}}** in the monitor chart's unit.

### Likely causes
An unavailable endpoint, incorrect path, authentication failure or blocked network access.

### Fix
Correct the observed endpoint failure and verify a real application operation.

### Verify
The next probe reports a successful 2xx response. Probe duration is not inference latency. If samples are absent, investigate the exporter and Collector: this threshold check cannot establish healthy operation without data.
